   "transcript": [
    {
     "start": 0.0,
     "end": 3.0,
     "text": "Yeah, kind of, kind of sort of maybe."
    },
    {
     "start": 3.0,
     "end": 6.0,
     "text": "Is this your birthday?"
    },
    {
     "start": 6.0,
     "end": 8.0,
     "text": "It's my birthday."
    },
    {
     "start": 8.0,
     "end": 10.0,
     "text": "Why?"
    },
    {
     "start": 10.0,
     "end": 13.0,
     "text": "Well, you know all the good stuff and all things."
    },
    {
     "start": 13.0,
     "end": 17.0,
     "text": "Well, what does it have to do with whose birthday it is?"
    }
   ],
   "transcript_note": "faster-whisper base model transcript was garbled; Dan corrected 2026-09-11: Fran's line was \"is this your birthday or my birthday\" \u2014 said because Suz was characteristically making everything about herself. Dan's correction outranks the model output."
